WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Heating systems keep people alive in winter. You need to know them cold.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Quiz covering gas furnace operation sequence, heat exchanger safety, electric
heat, heat pump operation, combustion analysis, and inspection procedures.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Here's why this matters on the job: Heating knowledge is tested on the
journeyman exam.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Watch out for these: Know the complete furnace ignition sequence. And — Know
what a cracked heat exchanger means

00:02:24.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Take a minute before you move on. What's the one thing from this lesson you need
to remember on a service call?

